
# SpendWise - Budget Tracker

## About the Project
SpendWise is a simple budget tracker that helps users
manage their income and expenses.

## Features
- Add expenses
- Enter expense amounts
- Select expense categories
- View expenses in a table
- Clean and responsive design

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## How to Run
1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open index.html in your browser.

## GitHub Repository
[SpendWise GitHub Repository](YOUR_ACTUAL_GITHUB_URL)

## Live Website
[Visit SpendWise](YOUR_ACTUAL_NETLIFY_URL)

## Deployment
The website is deployed using Netlify and connected
to GitHub for automatic redeployment when changes
are pushed to the repository.

## Reflection
This project helped me understand how to organize
website files, publish projects using GitHub, and
deploy websites using Netlify. I also learned how
continuous deployment works.
